==Battleground==
*1 [[Le'boin]] spawns after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Kang Roo]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Teacher Bear]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Satanmaria (Enemy)|Satanmaria]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Le'boin]] spawns.
**3 [[One Horn]]s spawn, delay 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 11.5 Update|version 11.5]], Le'boin was considered a boss alongside Satanmaria.

